# Manual scratch fixtures + a live-API probe, moved here from the repo root
# (2026-09-14). Untracked on purpose: the probe hits the billed Space and has
# hardcoded assumptions, and these files reached main once before via a
# `git add -A` from the wrong directory — ignoring the whole dir prevents a
# repeat.
